    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alarm Escalation with ACK + Timeout\\n\\nA small **alarm-management** workflow (not just a notifier):\\n\\n1. **Flood suppression** \u2014 repeated/flapping alarms are suppressed within a window\\n2. **Claude triage (advisory, non-blocking)** \u2014 summarizes + suggests likely cause\\n3. **Severity routing** \u2014 critical escalates, warning notifies once, info logs only\\n4. **Tiered escalation** \u2014 notify on-call, wait for ACK, escalate to the next\\n   person if no acknowledgment within the timeout\\n5. **Audit trail** \u2014 every outcome is logged (suppressed / ack'd / escalated)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "sn-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI is advisory only\\nClaude *summarizes* the alarm; it never decides suppression or who to notify \u2014 deterministic rules do. This node is **non-blocking** (onError = continue): if Claude is down or unconfigured, alarms still escalate.\\n\\nAdd a **Header Auth** credential: header `x-api-key` = your Anthropic key.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "sn-triage",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        250
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ACK pattern\\nEach notification includes `ackUrl` = `$execution.resumeUrl`. The recipient opens it (or your system POSTs `{ \"ack\": true }` to it) to acknowledge. No ACK within the timeout \u2192 escalate to the next tier.\\n\\n**Verify** the ACK condition expression and the Wait timeout for your n8n version.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "sn-ack",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Wire your notification channel\\nReplace the Notify URLs with your SMS / Slack / Teams / email endpoint. Keep the `ackUrl` field so recipients can acknowledge.",
        "height": 90,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sn-notify",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1300,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Audit trail\\nWire the `Log:` nodes to Google Sheets or a database so every alarm's outcome (suppressed / acknowledged / escalated) is recorded.",
        "height": 90,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sn-log",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2600,
        560
      ]
    }
